In that case, I have a feeling like there are probably many BAI that don't
quite fit the source brivla (not that that makes it ok to continue doing).

On Sun, Apr 10, 2011 at 8:10 PM, Ian Johnson <blindbravado@gmail.com> wrote:

> Pretty sure BAI == fi'o BAPLI. Loosening this rule was one of our ideas,
